# Spec §5.4: generated Turtle is UTF-8 with LF line endings, and CI checks it
# byte-for-byte (§6.5). Never let autocrlf rewrite line endings on checkout —
# a CRLF working copy on Windows would fail the determinism check.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ttl text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

*.xlsx binary
